        "gu_spirit_peach_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the blessed land, Fang Yuan weighs whom to subdue with rank five slavery Gu and lists Tao Zi among rank four Gu Masters still present, grouping him with figures such as Yi Huo, Kong Ri Tian, Li Xian, and Hu Mei Er. Fang Yuan’s first thought for a kill is not the strongest Yi Huo and is also not the influential Hu Mei Er and Tao Zi, but rather Tie Ruo Nan.",
      "chapters": [
        387
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "slavery-gu-shortlist",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
