        "char_kong_ri_tian",
        "char_li_xian",
        "char_hu_mei_er",
        "char_tie_ruo_nan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the righteous side stalls before the dog fog, the famous healer Tao Zi asks Xiao Mang what to do while the demonic faction watches. Later in the great clash he shouts for others to work together under his healing, and many Gu Masters gather to him.",
      "chapters": [
        393
      ],
